    "regime_notes": "10-day IC remained positive in all tested regimes: 2020-23 0.01219, 2024-26 0.00603, 2027-29 0.05170, 2030-32 0.10917, 2033-35 0.00720. Recent performance is weak and warrants conservative weighting and revalidation.",
